<title>POLAND: BANKS BID TO FOR PLN 809 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>BANKS BID TO FOR PLN 809 MLN OF NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish money market dealers bid to buy 258 million zlotys of the National Bank of Poland's 91-day bills against a 250 million offer and 551 million of its 182-day paper against a 500 million offer, the NBP said.</p>
<p>Full details of the tender should be available later today.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
